     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2: Ensure peace dividends for community interdependence and co-existence are delivered through diverse livelihoods options and effective natural resource management:

1. Community savings groups:
- 6 Groups - 150 women: These are newly formed groups which will be trained and supported to start their savings.

2. Income Generating Activities (IGAs):
- 100 women: The women were selected and trained in various IGA activities.</narrative>
      </comment>
